    "sections": {
        "description": "Prespa LMS serves as a child theme of Prespa, inheriting all the features of Prespa. It is a minimalist and simple e-learning theme that can be used as a learning management system to manage free and premium courses. The theme integrates flawlessly with Tutor LMS and WooCommerce plugins to create the highest possible learning experience. It is suitable for schools, student portals, teacher portals, education centers, universities, virtual classrooms, educational portals, training centers, coaching platforms and others. You can create unlimited courses, quizes and online assessments. It can also be used to manage students and instructors. You can even create Udemy or Coursera type of website where different people and organizations can sell their courses on your platform."
    },
